"bd-丰缘 bw-1 roundyright bgl-丰缘 td-绿宝石\" colspan=\"4\">第三世代\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hide\">\n<td class=\"bd-神奥 bw-1 roundyleft bgwhite tl-神奥\" colspan=\"6\">第四世代\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-合众 bw-1 roundyright bgl-合众 td-合众\" colspan=\"6\">第五世代\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hide\">\n<td class=\"bd-卡洛斯 bw-1 roundyleft bgl-X td-Y\" colspan=\"6\">Ｘ／Ｙ\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-丰缘 bw-1 roundyright bgl-OR td-AS\" colspan=\"6\">Ω紅寶石／α藍寶石\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hide\">\n<td class=\"bd-阿罗拉 bw-1 roundyleft bgl-太阳 td-月亮\" colspan=\"3\">太陽／月亮\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-阿罗拉 bw-1 bgl-究极之日 td-究极之月\" colspan=\"3\">究日／究月\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-关都 bw-1 bgwhite tl-关都\" colspan=\"3\">LG皮卡丘\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-关都 bw-1 roundyright bgwhite tl-关都\" colspan=\"3\">LG伊布\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hide\">\n<td class=\"bd-伽勒尔 bw-1 roundyleft bgwhite tl-伽勒尔\" colspan=\"3\">劍／盾\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-伽勒尔 bw-1 bgwhite tl-伽勒尔\" colspan=\"3\">擴充票\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-神奥 bw-1 bgwhite tl-神奥\" colspan=\"3\">晶鑽／明珠\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-洗翠 bw-1 roundyright bgwhite tl-洗翠\" colspan=\"3\">阿爾宙斯\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"\">\n<td class=\"bd-帕底亚 bw-1 roundyleft bgl-朱 td-紫\" colspan=\"3\">朱／紫\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-帕底亚 bw-1 bgl-碧之假面 td-蓝之圆盘\" colspan=\"3\">零之秘寶\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-ZA bw-1 bgwhite tl-卡洛斯\" colspan=\"3\">Z-A\n</td>\n<td class=\"bd-ZA bw-1 roundyright bgwhite tl-卡洛斯\" colspan=\"3\">爆涌\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bgwhite at-l\" colspan=\"12\" style=\"font-size: smaller;\">\n<ul><li>不是<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%99%A8\" title=\"招式學習器\">招式學習器</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%98%E4%BC%A0%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%99%A8\" title=\"秘傳學習器\">秘傳學習器</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95\" title=\"招式紀錄\">招式紀錄</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%82%B3%E6%8E%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F\" title=\"傳授招式\">傳授招式</a>。</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hide\">\n<td class=\"at-l bgwhite b-格斗 bw-1 roundy plainlinks\" style=\"font-size: smaller; padding-left: 8px;\">\n<ul><li>旁支系列遊戲中的<big><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%97%81%E6%94%AF%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"格鬥暴衝（旁支系列）（頁面不存在）\">格鬥暴衝</a></big></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>格鬥暴衝</b>（日文︰<b><span lang=\"ja\">ファイトアクセル</span></b>，英文︰<b><span lang=\"en\">Combat Torque</span></b>）是<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E4%B8%96%E4%BB%A3\" title=\"第九世代\">第九世代</a>引入的<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%89\" title=\"格鬥（屬性）\">格鬥屬性</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F\" title=\"招式\">招式</a>。\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目次</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#招式附加效果\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">招式附加效果</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#可以学会该招式的宝可梦\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">可以學會該招式的寶可夢</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#动画中\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">動畫中</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#漫画中\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">漫畫中</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#招式动画\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">招式動畫</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#名字\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">名字</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#细节\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">細節</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8B.9B.E5.BC.8F.E9.99.84.E5.8A.A0.E6.95.88.E6.9E.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"招式附加效果\">招式附加效果</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：招式附加效果\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 招式附加效果\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>攻擊目標造成傷害。\n</p><p>格鬥暴衝有30%的機率使目標陷入<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BA%BB%E7%97%B9%EF%BC%88%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%89\" title=\"麻痺（狀態）\">麻痺</a>狀態。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8F.AF.E4.BB.A5.E5.AD.A6.E4.BC.9A.E8.AF.A5.E6.8B.9B.E5.BC.8F.E7.9A.84.E5.AE.9D.E5.8F.AF.E6.A2.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"可以学会该招式的宝可梦\">可以學會該招式的寶可夢</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：可以學會該招式的寶可夢\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 可以學會該招式的寶可夢\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>只有<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9E%87%E7%90%B6\" title=\"枇琶\">枇琶</a>的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%8B%E8%89%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E6%98%9F%E9%98%9F%E8%BD%A6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"王良一天星隊車\">王良一天星隊車</a>能夠使用這個招式。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8A.A8.E7.94.BB.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"动画中\">動畫中</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：動畫中\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 動畫中\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.BC.AB.E7.94.BB.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"漫画中\">漫畫中</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：漫畫中\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 漫畫中\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8B.9B.E5.BC.8F.E5.8A.A8.E7.94.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"招式动画\">招式動畫</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節：招式動畫\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%97%E6%9A%B4%E5%86%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 招式動畫\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"a-c at-c bgl-格斗 b-格斗 roundy bw-2 collapsible collapsed\" c